<Layout title="Electric bike shortlist: picks by riding style" description="A focused electric bike shortlist for commuting, relaxed weekend rides, and city trips. Compare fit and specifications without numerical rankings."><div class="wrap"><div class="page-head"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Our shortlist</div><h1>The best fit<br/>starts with you.</h1><p class="intro">Three electric bikes to consider, chosen for different riding priorities. Find your use case, then read the details.</p></div><div class="answer"><span class="kicker">The quick answer</span><p>Start with the Pace 5 REC for relaxed cruising, the Roadster V3 for a pared-back city setup, or the XPress2 Commuter for a daily transport brief with front suspension. These are editorial picks by use, based on manufacturer specifications and ownership considerations.</p></div><div class="product-grid section">{products.map(p=><ProductCard product={p}/>)}</div><div class="narrow prose"><h2>How to choose between them.</h2><p>Fit, storage, and your regular route should settle the shortlist before motor output does. Compare the frames, charging arrangements, and service options. A manufacturer range figure is useful context, but it cannot tell you how far you will ride on your own route.</p><p><a href="/compare">Compare the specifications side by side</a>, then use our <a href="/guides/choose-your-first-ebike">first electric bike guide</a> to work through the purchase decision.</p></div></div></Layout>
